      "title": "File:Dr. Damien Hasola works in Orthopaedics at Buka Hospital - Bougainville (26042771554).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c8/Dr._Damien_Hasola_works_in_Orthopaedics_at_Buka_Hospital_-_Bougainville_%2826042771554%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
